    title: 'Custom Film Specification',
    desc: 'Arena glass is rarely flat. Our team specifies the correct film and adhesive system for each unique glass geometry in your venue — with particular attention to thermally stressed zones, curved panels, and high-traffic entry areas. You receive a written proposal with 2–3 film options and verified performance data.',
